unions.comment:
 A TLS version, as the handshake agreed on it.

The backends report the version by its OpenSSL name, and the names map to the cases as follows:

  - `Tls1_0`: `"TLSv1"`;
  - `Tls1_1`: `"TLSv1.1"`;
  - `Tls1_2`: `"TLSv1.2"`;
  - `Tls1_3`: `"TLSv1.3"`;
  - `UnknownTlsVersion name`: any other name, as it was reported.
